#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "TraitTransient:157:0:0"
msgid "Reduces <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Infuriate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> recast time by 5 seconds upon landing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fell Cleave</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Decimate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> on most targets."
msgstr "При попадании по большинству целей умениями <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Рассекающий удар</ui-edge-color></ui-color> или <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Децимация</ui-edge-color></ui-color> сокращает время перезарядки <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ярости</ui-edge-color></ui-color> на 5 сек."

