msgid "Allows for immediate execution of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Wheeling Thrust</ui-edge-color></ui-color> after landing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fang and Claw</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fang and Claw</ui-edge-color></ui-color> after landing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Wheeling Thrust</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, increasing potency by 100."
