msgid "Upgrades <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Katon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hyoton</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Goka Mekkyaku</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hyosho Ranryu</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Kassatsu</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
