msgid "Upgrades <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dosis</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dosis II</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Phlegma</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Phlegma II</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Eukrasian Dosis</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Eukrasian Dosis II</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Also increases the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Toxikon</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 300."
