msgid "Allows for <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Soul Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> accumulation upon the landing of certain weaponskills and magic actions, or defeating enemies under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Death's Design</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
