msgctxt "TraitTransient:380:0:0"
msgid "Increases the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Slice</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 300, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Waxing Slice</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 140, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Shadow of Death</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 300, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Harpe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 300, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Spinning Scythe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 140, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Infernal Slice</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 140, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Whorl of Death</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 100, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Nightmare Scythe</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 120."
