msgid "Grants the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Draconian Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> after successfully completing a combo with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Coerthan Torment</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br>Effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Draconian Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ends upon execution of any melee weaponskill.<br>Upgrades <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Doom Spike</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Draconian Fury</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Draconian Fire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
