msgid "Increases the potency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ruin III</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 310, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Ruby Rite</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 510, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Topaz Rite</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 330, and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Emerald Rite</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to 230."
