msgid "Grants 1 stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Rattling Coil</ui-edge-color></ui-color> upon successfully landing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Vicewinder</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Vicepit</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
