msgid "Grants a stack of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Burgeoning Fury</ui-edge-color></ui-color> upon landing <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Fell Cleave</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Decimate</ui-edge-color></ui-color> while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Inner Release</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>30s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Maximum Stacks: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>3<br>At maximum stacks, become <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Wrathful</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, upgrading <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Inner Release</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Primal Wrath</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
